      "writtenOn": "2020-01-14T16:39:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If DPTF is alive, DPTF should call dptf_set_fan_duty_target, which allows DPTF take over the fan control from EC, right? Why do we need another call (i.e. line 202)?\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/common/acpi.c#323",
      "parentUuid": "c7ec63f0_764577fa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 200,
